       "id": "26321642"
      }
     ],
     "value": "Along with COX14, core component of the MITRAC (mitochondrial translation regulation assembly intermediate of cytochrome c oxidase complex) complex (Probable) (PubMed:23260140). Interacts with MT-CO1/COX1, SMIM20, SURF1 and TIMM21 (PubMed:26321642)"
